      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/bit_field" target="_blank">bit field</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is the types of the detected object or avatar.</p>
</p>
